icable-no-pictures","rationale":"A new literal-detail question, with an explicit key in the exact recorded source passage. Public passage familiarity is unknown; known source-family exposure excludes it."}},"audio":{"instruction":{"text":"What color were both bookmarks?","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"},"passage":{"text":"Amira found a bookmark beside the mystery books. Daniel's name was written on it in blue ink. Amira's own bookmark had her name in green. She gave the lost bookmark to the librarian. The librarian put it in Daniel's book box. Both bookmarks were strips of yellow card. They also had the same star drawn near one end. Their names and ink colours made them different. The librarian checked the blue writing before choosing a box. Amira kept the green one in her pocket.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/amira-found-a-bookmark-beside-the-mystery-books-daniel-s-name-was-written--751569610c.mp3","required":true,"provenance":"existing_approved_leda_passage_recording"},"choices":[{"choiceId":"lpp.listening_stories.t2.2-3.choice1","text":"yellow","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/yellow-1822a11edb.mp3","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"},{"choiceId":"lpp.listening_stories.t2.2-3.choice2","text":"blue","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/blue-f36c2e5c5f.mp3","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"},{"choiceId":"lpp.listening_stories.t2.2-3.choice3","text":"green","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/green-c7a53f6178.mp3","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"}]},"exposure":{"itemStatus":"reserved_original_question","priorExposureStatus":"unknown","sourceReuse":"approved_public_recorded_passage","sourceItemId":"lp3.key_details.l2.C.precise_detail.v3","publicStimulusFamilyId":"passage:4a23f27edff7707f2391","limitation":"The question is original; its recorded passage was previously public. Prior passage familiarity is unknown unless learner exposure records establish it."},"edi