hich treatment each cup received. She recorded the feeling before adding water to either cup.","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"suppressStimulusAudio":false,"allowsChoiceAudio":true,"media":{"requiredSources":[{"kind":"audio","role":"passage","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/two-cups-in-the-science-corner-held-the-same-soil-the-cup-with-a-red-label-ed0b940392.mp3","text":"Two cups in the science corner held the same soil. The cup with a red label had been watered. The cup with a blue label had stayed dry. Priya pressed a finger into each cup. The soil with the red label felt softer. Both cups stood on the same sunny shelf. Each held the same amount of soil from one bag. The labels helped her remember which treatment each cup received. She recorded the feeling before adding water to either cup."}],"decision":{"itemId":"lpp.listening_stories.t2.2-6","role":"text-only","paths":[],"constructReview":"approved","answerNeutral":"not-applicable-no-pictures","rationale":"A new literal-detail question, with an explicit key in the exact recorded source passage. Public passage familiarity is unknown; known source-family exposure excludes it."}},"audio":{"instruction":{"text":"Where did both soil cups stand?","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"},"passage":{"text":"Two cups in the science corner held the same soil. The cup with a red label had been watered. The cup with a blue label had stayed dry. Priya pressed a finger into each cup. The soil with the red label felt softer. Both cups stood on the same sunny shelf. Each held the same amount of soil from one bag. The labels helped her remember which treatment each cup received. She recorded the feeling before adding water to either cup.","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/two-cups-in-the-science-corner-held-the-same-soil-the-cup-with-a-red-label-ed0b940392.mp3","required":true,"provenance":"existing_approved_leda_passage_recording"},"choices":[{"ch