SS_LISTENING_DETAIL","prompt":"Which floor was in the dinosaur room?","choices":[{"id":"lpp.listening_stories.t2.2-23.choice1","label":"a carpeted floor","rationale":"D-OPPOSITE","audio":{"text":"a carpeted floor","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"}},{"id":"lpp.listening_stories.t2.2-23.choice2","label":"a smooth floor","rationale":"KEY","audio":{"text":"a smooth floor","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"}},{"id":"lpp.listening_stories.t2.2-23.choice3","label":"a rough floor","rationale":"D-OPPOSITE","audio":{"text":"a rough floor","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"}}],"answer":"lpp.listening_stories.t2.2-23.choice2","passage":"The museum put three rules beside the dinosaur room. Visitors had to walk on its smooth floor. They had to whisper so others could listen. They could take photos but could not use flash. A helper showed each group the rules before entering. The first rule kept people from slipping on the polished floor. The quiet voices helped visitors hear the short dinosaur recording. The photo rule protected the experience without banning cameras altogether. The notice listed those three rules together in large, clear writing.","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"suppressStimulusAudio":false,"allowsChoiceAudio":true,"media":{"requiredSources":[{"kind":"audio","role":"passage","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/the-museum-put-three-rules-beside-the-dinosaur-room-visitors-had-to-walk-o-a96b9ab113.mp3","text":"The museum put three rules beside the dinosaur room. Visitors had to walk on its smooth floor. They had to whisper so others could listen. They could take photos but could not use flash. A helper showed each group the rules before entering. The first rule kept people from slipping on the polished floor. The quiet voices helped visitors hear the short dinosaur recording. The photo rule protected the experience without banning cameras altogether. The notice