0ae","passage:b29fafc651d9db03c0ae","lp3.key_details.l2.A.which_is_not.v20"],"formatType":"PROGRESS_LISTENING_DETAIL","prompt":"Where would lunch be provided?","choices":[{"id":"lpp.listening_stories.t2.2-27.choice1","label":"the park","rationale":"KEY","audio":{"text":"the park","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"}},{"id":"lpp.listening_stories.t2.2-27.choice2","label":"the school","rationale":"D-OPPOSITE","audio":{"text":"the school","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"}},{"id":"lpp.listening_stories.t2.2-27.choice3","label":"the cafe","rationale":"D-OPPOSITE","audio":{"text":"the cafe","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"}}],"answer":"lpp.listening_stories.t2.2-27.choice1","passage":"The notice said to bring a hat and a water bottle. Lunch would be provided at the park. Children also needed shoes suitable for walking. The outing involved a long path with very little shade. A drink refill point would be available beside the picnic area. The school kitchen would send enough sandwiches for every child. Teachers wanted families to read the whole notice before packing. Bringing the listed items would leave less to carry during the walk.","displayPassageDuringResponse":false,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"suppressStimulusAudio":false,"allowsChoiceAudio":true,"media":{"requiredSources":[{"kind":"audio","role":"passage","path":"/audio/production/en-US/assessment_passage/the-notice-said-to-bring-a-hat-and-a-water-bottle-lunch-would-be-provided--ba1eec80ca.mp3","text":"The notice said to bring a hat and a water bottle. Lunch would be provided at the park. Children also needed shoes suitable for walking. The outing involved a long path with very little shade. A drink refill point would be available beside the picnic area. The school kitchen would send enough sandwiches for every child. Teachers wanted families to read the whole notice before packing. Bringing the listed items would leave less to carry during the walk."}],"deci