ne, twelve and three. The morning shadow stretched toward the fence. At noon, it was short and close to the pole. The afternoon shadow reached toward the gate. A child wrote the time beside each chalk mark. The marks stayed until rain washed them away that night. Photographs in the class notebook kept the results for their next lesson.","displayPassageDuringResponse":true,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"suppressStimulusAudio":true,"allowsChoiceAudio":true,"media":{"requiredSources":[],"decision":{"itemId":"lpp.reading_stories.t2.2-8","role":"text-only","paths":[],"constructReview":"approved","answerNeutral":"not-applicable-no-pictures","rationale":"The stated detail answers \"Where did the afternoon shadow reach?\". The alternatives contradict that detail or name another stated object. Passage replay is forbidden."}},"audio":{"instruction":{"text":"Where did the afternoon shadow reach?","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"},"choices":[{"choiceId":"lpp.reading_stories.t2.2-8.choice1","text":"close to the pole","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"},{"choiceId":"lpp.reading_stories.t2.2-8.choice2","text":"toward the gate","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"},{"choiceId":"lpp.reading_stories.t2.2-8.choice3","text":"toward the fence","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"}]},"exposure":{"itemStatus":"reserved_original_question","priorExposureStatus":"unknown","sourceReuse":"none","limitation":"New reserved text; learner exposure must still be checked at family level."},"editorial":{"note":"The stated detail answers \"Where did the afternoon shadow reach?\". The alternatives contradict that detail or name another stated object. Passage replay is forbidden.","keyReview":"one-explicit-key","originality":"original_reserved_content"},"retentionOnly":false,"nonGating":false},{"id":"lpp.reading_stories.t2.2-9","instrument":"adaptive_progress","reservedPurpose":"progress_test","contentStandardVersion":3,"trackId":"rea