}}],"answer":"lpp.reading_stories.t2.2-13.choice3","passage":"The cook tried three recipes for vegetable soup. The first used only carrots and onions. The second included potatoes, making it thicker. For the third she added beans instead of potatoes. Visitors tasted each soup from separate cups. The soup with potatoes received the most votes. The cook copied that recipe into her notebook and crossed out the bean recipe. She kept the simple carrot recipe for days when she had fewer ingredients available.","displayPassageDuringResponse":true,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"suppressStimulusAudio":true,"allowsChoiceAudio":true,"media":{"requiredSources":[],"decision":{"itemId":"lpp.reading_stories.t2.2-13","role":"text-only","paths":[],"constructReview":"approved","answerNeutral":"not-applicable-no-pictures","rationale":"The stated detail answers \"Which soup received the most votes?\". The alternatives contradict that detail or name another stated object. Passage replay is forbidden."}},"audio":{"instruction":{"text":"Which soup received the most votes?","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"},"choices":[{"choiceId":"lpp.reading_stories.t2.2-13.choice1","text":"the soup with beans","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"},{"choiceId":"lpp.reading_stories.t2.2-13.choice2","text":"the soup with only carrots","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"},{"choiceId":"lpp.reading_stories.t2.2-13.choice3","text":"the soup with potatoes","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"}]},"exposure":{"itemStatus":"reserved_original_question","priorExposureStatus":"unknown","sourceReuse":"none","limitation":"New reserved text; learner exposure must still be checked at family level."},"editorial":{"note":"The stated detail answers \"Which soup received the most votes?\". The alternatives contradict that detail or name another stated object. Passage replay is forbidden.","keyReview":"one-explicit-key","originality":"original_reserved_conten