x","rationale":"KEY","audio":{"text":"Alex","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"}}],"answer":"lpp.reading_stories.t2.2-28.choice3","passage":"The cooking club divided its jobs before making bread. Alex measured flour on the kitchen scale. Bea mixed warm water with yeast in a jug. Chen washed the bowls and dried them with a cloth. When everything was ready, Alex added the flour to a large bowl. Bea poured in the yeast mixture. Everyone took a turn kneading the dough. Chen then covered the bowl with the dry cloth while the dough rested in a warm place.","displayPassageDuringResponse":true,"hideWrittenLabels":false,"suppressStimulusAudio":true,"allowsChoiceAudio":true,"media":{"requiredSources":[],"decision":{"itemId":"lpp.reading_stories.t2.2-28","role":"text-only","paths":[],"constructReview":"approved","answerNeutral":"not-applicable-no-pictures","rationale":"The stated detail answers \"Who measured the flour?\". The alternatives contradict that detail or name another stated object. Passage replay is forbidden."}},"audio":{"instruction":{"text":"Who measured the flour?","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"},"choices":[{"choiceId":"lpp.reading_stories.t2.2-28.choice1","text":"Bea","path":"/audio/production/en-US/supplemental/bea-5a25b7bc30.mp3","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"},{"choiceId":"lpp.reading_stories.t2.2-28.choice2","text":"Chen","path":"/audio/production/en-US/isolated_word/chen-adf1861284.mp3","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"},{"choiceId":"lpp.reading_stories.t2.2-28.choice3","text":"Alex","path":"","required":false,"fallback":"speech_access"}]},"exposure":{"itemStatus":"reserved_original_question","priorExposureStatus":"unknown","sourceReuse":"none","limitation":"New reserved text; learner exposure must still be checked at family level."},"editorial":{"note":"The stated detail answers \"Who measured the flour?\". The alternatives contradict that detail or name another stated object. Passage replay 